---
import { company } from '../../data/site';
---
<section class="section theme-light">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2 class="h2">A Tanzanian company with an African outlook.</h2></div>
    <div class="stack">
      <p class="lede">Native Media is a Pan-African media-tech and strategic communication agency based in Dar es Salaam. {company.positioning}</p>
      <p>The company operates at the intersection of media, strategic communications, intelligence, research, storytelling, data, creative production and institutional engagement. It serves businesses, institutions, investors, policymakers, diplomatic missions and wider audiences.</p>
      <p>Intelligence is part of the company’s overall identity, not only a publication or a service. Native Media transforms information, research and African perspectives into strategic insight, compelling narratives and professional communication products.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section theme-dark why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our WHY</p>
    <blockquote><p>“{company.why}”</p></blockquote>
    <p class="lede">Native Media exists to contribute African perspectives, research, intelligence and storytelling to the way the continent is understood, represented and engaged with internationally.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section theme-light">
  <div class="wrap cards">
    <div class="card"><h3>Our vision</h3><p>{company.vision}</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Our mission</h3><p>{company.mission}</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Our brand promise</h3><p>{company.promise}</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .why .wrap { display: grid; gap: 1.6rem; }
  blockquote { margin: 0; }
  blockquote p { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: var(--step-5); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.035em; max-width: 16ch; }
  .why .lede { color: var(--paper); opacity: 0.8; }
</style>
